  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "No chapter describes the palace’s architecture when Longevity Heaven first reaches its site.",
      "chapters": [
        1711
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "appearance",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "fac_longevity_heaven"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Fairy Zi Wei recalls that Limitless Demon Venerable’s left path passes Central Heaven Gate, Name Plaque Palace, Sun Palace, Five Deity Hall, Central Great Hall, Heaven Overseeing Tower, Forgotten Dao Lake, and finally Imperfection Regret Pavilion on the peak of Star Zone Mountain.",
      "chapters": [
        1710
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "appearance",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_fairy_zi_wei",
        "char_limitless_demon_venerable",
        "house_central_heaven_gate",
        "loc_sun_palace",
        "loc_five_deity_hall",
        "loc_central_great_hall",
        "house_heaven_overseeing_tower",
        "loc_forgotten_dao_lake",
        "loc_imperfection_regret_pavilion",
        "loc_star_zone_mountain"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Calamity Luck Altar soon arrives where Name Plaque Palace should stand, but the palace has already flown high into the sky. Bing Sai Chuan says it is an information path Immortal Gu House: name plaques inside each hold a person’s name, and those people form a huge information network for Heavenly Court across the five regions. Five Elements Grandmaster notes that destroying it would expose that network, which is why Heavenly Court moved it away at any cost. Longevity Heaven had already expected the palace to flee, so Bing Sai Chuan orders the advance to continue without that obstruction.",
      "chapters": [
        1711
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "information-network-house",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "house_calamity_luck_altar",
        "char_bing_sai_chuan",
        "sys_immortal_gu_house",
        "fac_heavenly_court",
        "char_five_elements_grandmaster"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "In an Olden Antiquity Era recollection, when Limitless Demon Venerable attacked Heavenly Court, Name Plaque Palace did not even have time to fly away before his advance.",
      "chapters": [
        1714
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "limitless-breakthrough",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "evt_era_olden"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "During the fusion of the two heavens, Heavenly Court Gu Immortals call for reinforcements because Branded Name Palace is severely damaged.",
      "chapters": [
        2266
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
